.Dd @MAN_DATE@
.Dt GLYPHASTORE_REBUILD_INDEX 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm glyphastore_rebuild_index
.Nd durable v1 Index rebuild is not supported offline
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl hV
.Ar segment-file ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Durable persistence v1 does not persist a separate Index artifact.
Indexes rebuild from committed Segments during Store recovery.
.Pp
.Nm
(GlyphaStore
.Sy @PROJECT_VERSION@ )
permanently refuses Segment-only offline Index rebuild and documents the
operator path:
.Bl -enum -compact
.It
Reopen or restart the Store on the data directory (ordinary recovery).
.It
For offline catalog repair, use
.Xr glyphastore_repair_store 1
with an explicit empty workspace.
.El
.Pp
Help and version remain available.
Do not use this tool for durable v1 operations.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl h , Fl Fl help
Show help and exit 0.
.It Fl V , Fl Fl version
Show version and exit 0.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width Ds -compact
.It 0
Help or version only.
.It 1
Refused operation / failure.
.It 2
Usage error.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr glyphastore 7 ,
.Xr glyphastore_repair_store 1 ,
.Xr glyphastore_verify_store 1
.Sh AUTHORS
GlyphaStore contributors.
